{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは楽しみにしていたお仕事です！\nはやくみなさんに話したいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとびっくりしてくれると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(｡-∀-｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤ハチマキだけど\n学生のころは\n白組が多かったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生のころは\n体操着が一番\n似合ってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね！実はね！\n秘密にしてたんだけど手相の生命線が手の甲までいってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいでしょ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反射しちゃって\nめっちゃ短くなってる。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月29日の\nらじらー！さんに\nサンクエトワールで\nまた呼んで頂けました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月29日たのしみ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らじらー！スタッフさん\n藤森さん、中田さん\nよろしくお願い致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、前回は\nユニット名を募集し\nサンクエトワールと私たちのユニット名が決まったのですが、\n今回はそのサンクエトワールの\nキャッチフレーズを\n募集することになりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑\nらじらー！さんのホームページに\nサンクエトワールのキャッチフレーズ募集バナーがあるので\nぜひ、サンクエトワールのキャッチフレーズを送ってください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールっていう名前もそうだし、こうやってまたサンクエトワールのキャッチフレーズをファンの方とサンエトみんなで考えることができて嬉しいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールはファンの方皆さんと一緒につくりあげていきたいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願い致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はサンクエトワールみんなで\n撮影があるんだ♪\nこうやってサンクエトワールで\nいろいろな活動をさせていただけて\nとても楽しく嬉しく幸せです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールでこんなことをやってほしい！とか\nサンクエトワールのこんなところをみたい！とか\nいろいろ皆さんが思ったり考えたり\nサンクエトワールでできることを\n教えて頂きたいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海よりも大きくなる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/15/9868515/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またかきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーい！！！"}],"source":"archive"}